# Standalone project — no other-project context

This repository is a **standalone project**. Treat it as isolated from every other Cursor workspace, repo, lab, or prior engagement.

- Use only this conversation, files in this workspace, and tools run in this session.
- Do not recall, search, or reuse memories, decisions, preferences, paths, credentials, stack choices, or unfinished work from other projects.
- Do not search prior chats or agent transcripts from other workspaces unless the user explicitly asks.
- If a fact might have come from another project, ignore it and gather it again here by reading this repo or asking.

```
❌ BAD: "In the other infra repo we used that cluster layout, so I'll reuse it here."
✅ GOOD: Inspect this repository (or ask) before assuming paths, stack, naming, or prior decisions.
```
